    narr:narration """As of July 2026, the Meridian deployment pipeline has been updated to require a [signed release manifest](narr:Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_1) for all staging and production artifacts. This gate, [owned by Quinton Fairweather](narr:Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_7), was implemented as a direct response to [past security lapses](narr:Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_3) involving unsigned artifacts reaching staging environments. The documentation, framed through [editorial summaries](narr:Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_4) and [direct testimony](narr:Expr_1ProtectedBaseProbe_2), establishes this as a mandatory conservation measure to ensure deployment integrity.""" ;
